{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15128","headline":"莲塘驿 · 李益","name":"莲塘驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五月渡淮水，南行遶山陂。\n江村远鸡应，竹里闻缲丝。\n楚女肌发美，莲塘烟露滋。\n菱花覆碧渚，黄鸟双飞时。\n渺渺泝洄远，凭风托微词。\n斜光动流睇，此意难自持。\n女歌本轻艳，客行多怨思。\n女萝蒙幽蔓，拟上青桐枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}